**Describe the bug**
The problem arises when I use it with minify option by setting the target of jsc to es2016~es2020.
JavaScript cannot be executed because the class name and `extends` keyword are stuck.

**Input code**

```js
class Hello {
  constructor() {
    console.log('hello');
  }
}

class Hi extends Hello {
  constructor() {
    console.log('hi');
  }
}
```

**Output code**

```js
class Hello{constructor(){console.log('hello');}}class Hiextends Hello {constructor(){console.log('hi');}}
                                                       ^^^^^^^^^
```

**Config**

```json
{
  "jsc": {
    "parser": {
      "syntax": "ecmascript"
    },
    "target": "es2016"
  },
  "minify": true
}
```

**Version**
The version of @swc/core: 1.2.58
